+| en | device-provided (Web Speech API) | not verified | optional (Web Speech API, consent) | not verified |
+| es | device-provided (Web Speech API) | not verified | optional (Web Speech API, consent) | not verified |
+| zh-Hans | device-provided (Web Speech API) | not verified | optional (Web Speech API, consent) | not verified |
+| hi | device-provided (Web Speech API) | not verified | optional (Web Speech API, consent) | not verified |
+| ar | device-provided (Web Speech API) | not verified | optional (Web Speech API, consent) | not verified |
